#: ../../toaster-manual/reference.rst:564
msgid "``builddelete``"
msgstr "``builddelete``"

#: ../../toaster-manual/reference.rst:566
msgid ""
"The ``builddelete`` command deletes data associated with a build. Access "
"the command as follows:"
msgstr "Il comando ``builddelete`` elimina i dati associati a una build. Per accedervi, procedere come segue:"

#: ../../toaster-manual/reference.rst:573
msgid ""
"The command deletes all the build data for the specified build_id. This "
"command is useful for removing old and unused data from the database."
msgstr "Il comando elimina tutti i dati del build_id specificato. Questo comando è utile per rimuovere i dati vecchi e inutilizzati dal database."

