#: ../../toaster-manual/setup-and-use.rst:113
msgid "The Directory for Cloning Layers"
msgstr "La Directory per la Clonazione dei Layer"

#: ../../toaster-manual/setup-and-use.rst:115
msgid ""
"Toaster creates a ``_toaster_clones`` directory inside your Source "
"Directory (i.e. ``poky``) to clone any layers needed for your builds."
msgstr "Toaster crea una directory ``_toaster_clones`` all'interno della Source Directory (ad esempio ``poky``) per clonare tutti i layer necessari per le build."

#: ../../toaster-manual/setup-and-use.rst:118
msgid ""
"Alternatively, if you would like all of your Toaster related files and "
"directories to be in a particular location other than the default, you "
"can set the ``TOASTER_DIR`` environment variable, which takes precedence "
"over your current working directory. Setting this environment variable "
"causes Toaster to create and use ``$TOASTER_DIR./_toaster_clones``."
msgstr "In alternativa, se si desidera che tutti i file e le directory relativi a Toaster si trovino in una posizione diversa da quella predefinita, è possibile impostare la variabile d'ambiente ``TOASTER_DIR``, che ha la precedenza sulla directory di lavoro corrente. Impostando questa variabile d'ambiente, Toaster crea e utilizza ``$TOASTER_DIR./_toaster_clones``."

#: ../../toaster-manual/setup-and-use.rst:125
msgid "The Build Directory"
msgstr "La Build Directory"

#: ../../toaster-manual/setup-and-use.rst:127
msgid ""
"Toaster creates a :term:`Build Directory` within your Source Directory "
"(e.g. ``poky``) to execute the builds."
msgstr "Toaster crea una :term:`Build Directory` all'interno della Source Directory (ad esempio ``poky``) per eseguire le build."

#: ../../toaster-manual/setup-and-use.rst:130
msgid ""
"Alternatively, if you would like all of your Toaster related files and "
"directories to be in a particular location, you can set the "
"``TOASTER_DIR`` environment variable, which takes precedence over your "
"current working directory. Setting this environment variable causes "
"Toaster to use ``$TOASTER_DIR/build`` as the :term:`Build Directory`."
msgstr "In alternativa, se si desidera che tutti i file e le directory relativi a Toaster si trovino in una posizione specifica, si può impostare la variabile d'ambiente ``TOASTER_DIR``, che ha la precedenza sulla directory di lavoro corrente. Impostando questa variabile d'ambiente, Toaster utilizzerà ``$TOASTER_DIR/build`` come :term:`Build Directory`."

